# Modules

Current modules:

- notebooks
- notes
- drawing
- settings

Each module should be as self-contained as possible.

Feature-specific:

- components belong in components/
- hooks belong in hooks/
- models belong in models/
- screens belong in pages/
- feature operations belong in services/
- pure helpers belong in utils/

Do not import internal implementation details from another module unless strictly necessary.

Do not create global code merely for convenience.

Move code to shared layers only when it has a real reuse case.